(Nova Learning Academy - Student Handbook 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Attendance Policy) Tj T*
(Students must attend at least 75 percent of classes to sit the final exam.) Tj T*
(Three late arrivals \(more than 10 minutes\) count as one absence.) Tj T*
(Medical leave requires a doctor's note submitted within 3 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Assignment Rules) Tj T*
(Assignments are submitted through the student portal before 11:59 PM.) Tj T*
(Late submissions lose 10 percent of the marks per day, up to 3 days.) Tj T*
(After 3 days a late assignment receives zero marks.) Tj T*
(Plagiarism leads to zero marks and a meeting with the course coordinator.) Tj T*
ET
