(3. Grading) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Final grade = 40 percent assignments + 20 percent quizzes + 40 percent final exam.) Tj T*
(Grade A starts at 85 percent, B at 70 percent, C at 55 percent.) Tj T*
(Students below 55 percent may take one re-sit exam per course.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
